    <div id="screen-intro"><div class="intro-box"><h2 style="text-align:center;">Welcome, Family.</h2><p>You are about to embark on a journey that bridges the digital world with the dirt beneath your feet. This is not a game you play by staring at a screen; it is a game you play by living real life.</p><h3>1. Competence, Not Just Points</h3><p>In most games, you click a button and your character levels up. In *The Village RPG*, <strong>you</strong> are the character. To earn badges and upgrade your avatar, you must build real-world skills. The real-world reward is <em>competence</em>. The digital reward is watching your avatar evolve.</p><h3>2. The Team Roster</h3><p>Every quest requires a team effort. When you complete a task, you must assign roles. <strong>Note: Multiple people can hold the same role!</strong> If three kids are all scrubbing dishes, they are all Trackers.</p><ul><li><strong>🏃 Tracker(s):</strong> The people doing the physical labor.</li><li><strong>📷 Witness(es):</strong> The people catching the story (taking photos, asking "What did you notice?").</li><li><strong>🔥 Hearth Tender(s):</strong> The people holding the space (making tea, prepping tools).</li></ul><h3>3. The Coyote Mentoring Rule</h3><p>Parents, do not give your kids the answers. If the quest asks, "Why does hot water melt fat?", do not hand them a textbook. Ask them, "I wonder why the cold water made the grease hard?" Let them sit with the question.</p><h3>4. The "Otis" Verification Protocol</h3><p>To get officially certified on Permies.com, you must follow the Otis Protocol for photos:<ul><li><strong>Before:</strong> Raw materials/site.</li><li><strong>During:</strong> You in the act of working.</li><li><strong>After:</strong> Finished product WITH a physical sign showing your name and date.</li></ul></p><button class="success" onclick="document.getElementById('nav-bar').style.display='flex'; showScreen('setup');">Click Here to Begin Setup</button></div></div>
    
    <div id="screen-setup" style="display: none;"><h2>Create Your Village</h2><div class="setup-section"><h3>1. Choose Your Biome</h3><select id="biome-select" onchange="setBiome(this.value)" style="background: #111; color: white; border: 1px solid #555; padding: 10px; border-radius: 4px; width: 100%;"><option value="apartment">🏢 Apartment (PEA Path)</option><option value="suburb">🏡 Suburban Home (PEP Path)</option><option value="rural">🚜 Rural / Acreage (PEP Path)</option></select></div><div class="setup-section"><h3>2. Create Your Family Team</h3><div id="player-list"></div><button onclick="addPlayer()" style="width: 100%; padding: 10px;">+ Add Player</button></div><button onclick="saveVillage()" class="success" style="padding: 10px;">Save & Enter Village</button></div>
    
